{% assign source = site.data.paper_sources[page.paper_url] %}
{% if source %}
  <aside class="paper-source" aria-label="{% if page.lang == 'zh-CN' %}论文出处{% else %}Publication source{% endif %}">
    <p>
      {{ source.authors }}
      <a href="{{ page.paper_url }}">{{ source.title }}</a>. <em>{{ source.venue }}</em>.
    </p>
    <p>
      {% if source.supplied_pdf and page.lang == 'zh-CN' -%}
        场景图提取自作者提供的正式出版稿（图 1）；流程图为方法概要重绘。完整论文见出版链接。
      {%- elsif source.supplied_pdf -%}
        Scenario illustration cropped from the author-supplied published paper (Fig. 1); the method flow is a redrawn summary. See the publisher link
        for the full paper.
      {%- elsif page.lang == 'zh-CN' -%}
        图片提取自 ePrints 接收稿，保留原始坐标轴与图例；流程图为方法概要重绘。原文与授权说明见论文记录。
      {%- else -%}
        Figures are cropped from the ePrints accepted manuscript with the original axes and legends retained; method diagrams are redrawn summaries.
        See the publication record for the manuscript and reuse terms.
      {%- endif %}
    </p>
  </aside>
{% endif %}
